# Bedtime Routine Shortcut
# runs when you're about to sleep

1. Set Alarm for 7:00 AM tomorrow
2. Set Focus Mode: Sleep (until 7:00 AM)
3. Set Brightness to 10%
4. Play Sound: "White Noise" (in Background)
5. Set App Limits:
   - Instagram: 0 hours
   - TikTok: 0 hours  
   - Twitter/X: 0 hours
   - Snapchat: 0 hours
6. Show Notification: "Good night! Phone locked until morning."

# Pro tip: Add this to Automation -> When Battery Level < 20%
# so it reminds you to go to bed when your phone is dying lol
